            "type": "code",
            "value": "Promise.any"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "："
          },
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "第一个 fulfilled 即成功"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "；全部 rejected 才抛 "
          },
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "AggregateError"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "。适合多 CDN / 多镜像任一可用即可的兜底。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "value": "示例："
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "四个静态方法取向对照。"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "type": "code",
            "value": "const ps = [Promise.resolve(1), Promise.reject('e')]\n\nPromise.all(ps)        // 一项失败则整体失败\nPromise.allSettled(ps) // 等全部落定，带 status\nPromise.race(ps)       // 谁先完成用谁（成功或失败）\nPromise.any(ps)        // 谁先成功用谁；全失败才 AggregateError"
          }
        ]
